>**{c=red:You must zone and wait until the next game day after completing }{q:Comeback Queen|Comeback Queen|Comeback Queen}{c=red: to begin this quest.}**
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Laila} as a level 66 {p:Dancer} or higher to begin this quest.
* Head to {z:Grauberg (S)} or {z:North Gustaberg (S)} and kill Young, Amber, Amethyst and Veteran Quadav there until you get a {i:Dancer's Testimony|Dnc. Testimony|2556}.
* Trade the {i:Dancer's Testimony|Dnc. Testimony|2556} to {n:Laila} who will teleport you to {z:Qu'Bia Arena}.
* Trade the Testimony to the Burning Circle there to enter a battle against {n:Laila}.
** There is a 10 minute time limit for this fight.
** If you have the {k:"Rhapsody in Umber"} Key Item, you are able to summon {p:Trust Magic} to aid you.
* Bring {n:Laila} to approximately 25% {p:HP} to win the fight.

=2 Notes
* Does not need to be completed (for level limit increasing) if the player has already completed {q:New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await} or better.

